    <h2 id="d-f-h">Leading and teaching</h2>
    <h3>AI lead, KAU Engineering Day</h3>
    <p>Led 10 developers to ship 4 products, including the chatbot, games and robotics, while running code reviews and deployments. Named the tech department’s Member of the Month and honored at the closing ceremony.</p>
