    <h3>From Zero to Cloud bootcamp</h3>
    <p>Two days with the Oracle Student Club for 55+ students. They SSH’d into cloud VMs, containerized Node.js and Flask apps with Docker, then hunted down the bugs in a broken Dockerfile and shipped the fix.</p>
    <div class="gal"><Pic name="boot" alt="The bootcamp room from above" class="wide" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 92vw, 610px" /><Pic name="bootTalk" alt="Presenting cloud certifications" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 46vw, 300px" /><Pic name="bootLap" alt="Students' deployed pages" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 46vw, 300px" /><Pic name="bootGroup" alt="Group photo with bootcamp attendees" class="wide" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 92vw, 610px" /></div>
